12. Survivor and Old promotion

Suppose:
        Young object
              ↓
        survives GC
              ↓
        Survivor
              ↓
        survives again
              ↓
        Survivor
              ↓
        survives sufficiently long
              ↓
        Old

The basic intuition is:
                    Eden
                      ↓
                    Survivor
                      ↓
                    Old

But don't present the age threshold as a rigid guarantee.
G1 uses policies and heuristics around aging, survivor sizing, promotion, and available regions.
